' ============================================================================
' S2 (entry only) — the "full" entry point into Authorising. Transitions-only
' scoping: neither WaitingForDriver, authFull nor any other endpoint carries
' a $scenario_state tag, because all of them are shared with every other
' in-service scenario. Unlike view_transitions_only.puml in the synthetic
' example, this one is *not* missing anything by only touching
' $scenario_link — there is nothing scenario-exclusive on this route to
' auto-hide in the first place.
' ============================================================================

@startuml view_charge_post_s02_nominal_entry

!include charge-post-model.iuml

hide $scenario_link
show $s02_nominal_session

@enduml
